      "mergeID": "652ed21a18b1ce321096ff38",
      "mergedPostDetails": "The mesh collider disappears.\n\nThe mesh collider is the default layer and Convex is checked.\n\nLocal players cannot collide with this mesh collider, and the default and pickup layer colliders in the world will not collide.\n\nThe Live Client player in the same instance confirms that the mesh collider collides correctly.\n\nThis phenomenon was observed in the following worlds.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_527c7009-391c-4da5-a07a-9558f2ca3d3e",
      "mergedPostTitle": "[1354] The mesh collider disappears.",
      "parentID": null,
      "pinned": false,
      "postDeleted": false,
      "postID": "6504c5a32109dc517f1a4437",
      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I cannot locate actual canny but this is tracked issue.\n\nWay to fix it is enable \"Read/Write Mesh\" on FBX.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
