  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I found this world where in a few areas I was falling thru the ground but my friend not.\n\nAfter some testing I found out it's because I'm on the Unity 22 beta. When I changed to the 2019 version I wasn't falling thru the ground any more.\n\nThere are also some buttons that don't work on the beta.\n\nHere is the world: https://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_a66fcc14-9d4f-4abc-be0c-da53d23a886d\n\nIt's not my world nor do I know the creator so I can't say why this is happening. But I wanted to report it in case there are more worlds with the same problem.\n\nHere is a video showing both versions: https://youtu.be/0r6xZvgxMyM",
